        "detailed_description": "26 characters from across AQUAPLUS's classic franchises clash in this action-packed fighting game! Master your favorite heroes from games and anime including <i>Utawarerumono</i>, <i>To Heart 2</i>, <i>White Album</i>, and more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/d98a7d977426231cdced850f3ef2ed31.avif?t=1782997867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras_big/d98a7d977426231cdced850f3ef2ed31.avif?t=1782997867 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>Pick from a roster of over a dozen fan favorites. Dominate the battlefield with your character's unique moveset and movement!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/5944f0bde6f2b36499f82eeba629c9bb.poster.avif?t=1782997867\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/5944f0bde6f2b36499f82eeba629c9bb.webm?t=1782997867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/5944f0bde6f2b36499f82eeba629c9bb.mp4?t=1782997867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight hard and make aggressive plays to keep your character in peak form with the Active Emotion System!<br></li><li>Finish your opponents off with devastating and powerfully animated Splash Arts!<br></li><li>Bring new friends to the couch anytime with the optional Simple control scheme!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/c98bf67fdb7b29d68be39ce928976b92.avif?t=1782997867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras_big/c98bf67fdb7b29d68be39ce928976b92.avif?t=1782997867 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>You don't just pick one character to control: select one of a dozen more partner characters, then call on them for powerful assists that can change the course of the fight!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/d8cd2eb8b31996a23aef129ef9b82bd6.poster.avif?t=1782997867\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/d8cd2eb8b31996a23aef129ef9b82bd6.webm?t=1782997867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/d8cd2eb8b31996a23aef129ef9b82bd6.mp4?t=1782997867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
        "about_the_game": "26 characters from across AQUAPLUS's classic franchises clash in this action-packed fighting game! Master your favorite heroes from games and anime including <i>Utawarerumono</i>, <i>To Heart 2</i>, <i>White Album</i>, and more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/d98a7d977426231cdced850f3ef2ed31.avif?t=1782997867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras_big/d98a7d977426231cdced850f3ef2ed31.avif?t=1782997867 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>Pick from a roster of over a dozen fan favorites. Dominate the battlefield with your character's unique moveset and movement!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/5944f0bde6f2b36499f82eeba629c9bb.poster.avif?t=1782997867\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/5944f0bde6f2b36499f82eeba629c9bb.webm?t=1782997867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/5944f0bde6f2b36499f82eeba629c9bb.mp4?t=1782997867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight hard and make aggressive plays to keep your character in peak form with the Active Emotion System!<br></li><li>Finish your opponents off with devastating and powerfully animated Splash Arts!<br></li><li>Bring new friends to the couch anytime with the optional Simple control scheme!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/c98bf67fdb7b29d68be39ce928976b92.avif?t=1782997867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras_big/c98bf67fdb7b29d68be39ce928976b92.avif?t=1782997867 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>You don't just pick one character to control: select one of a dozen more partner characters, then call on them for powerful assists that can change the course of the fight!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/d8cd2eb8b31996a23aef129ef9b82bd6.poster.avif?t=1782997867\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/d8cd2eb8b31996a23aef129ef9b82bd6.webm?t=1782997867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229260/extras/d8cd2eb8b31996a23aef129ef9b82bd6.mp4?t=1782997867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
